## The bug

`mj codegen manifest --open-app-client-bootstrap` emitted a **bare side-effect import** for each Open App client package:

```ts
// BEGIN Open App client bootstrap
import '@mj-biz-apps/committees-ng';
// END Open App client bootstrap
```

Bundlers are permitted to drop a bare side-effect

@MarceloT-BC @AN-BC for review.

## The bug

When a Table-Per-Type (IS-A) child's **parent** save fails, `BaseEntity.Save` rolls back and returns `false` **without recording anything on the child's `ResultHistory`**. Every result was written to the parent object, which callers have no reference to —
